span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"适合批处理的场景识别\">适合批处理的场景识别</h2><p>核心判据：<strong>用户是否在等这个结果？</strong> 如果不是，就应该走批处理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>实时必要性</th>\n<th>批处理适用性</th>\n<th>预期量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>聊天回复</td>\n<td>必须实时</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮件分类</td>\n<td>分钟级可接受</td>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>千-万/天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容审核</td>\n<td>秒级到分钟级</td>\n<td>部分适用</td>\n<td>万-十万/天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据标注</td>\n<td>无实时要求</td>\n<td>极佳</td>\n<td>千-万/批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型评估</td>\n<td>无实时要求</td>\n<td>极佳</td>\n<td>百-千/批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报告生成</td>\n<td>小时级可接受</td>\n<td>极佳</td>\n<td>十-百/天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档摘要</td>\n<td>分钟级可接受</td>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>百-千/天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEO 内容生成</td>\n<td>无实时要求</td>\n<td>极佳</td>\n<td>百-万/批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>翻译任务</td>\n<td>分钟到小时</td>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>百-千/天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>经验法则</strong>：一个典型的 AI 产品中，30-50% 的 LLM 调用可以延迟处理而不影响用户体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异步架构模式\">异步架构模式</h2><h3 id=\"队列化架构\">队列化架构</h3><p>将 LLM 调用从同步请求-响应模式改为异步队列模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LLMJob {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  priority: &#39;realtime&#39; | &#39;high&#39; | &#39;normal&#39; | &#39;batch&#39;;&#10;  payload: {&#10;    model: string;&#10;    messages: Message[];&#10;    max_tokens: number;&#10;  };&#10;  callback_url?: string;&#10;  created_at: number;&#10;  deadline: number; // 最晚完成时间&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LLMJob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'realtime'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'normal'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'batch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    messages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  callback_url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deadline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最晚完成时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优先级分层调度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>SLA</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>realtime</td>\n<td>&lt;3s</td>\n<td>同步 API，即时返回</td>\n<td>全价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>high</td>\n<td>&lt;5min</td>\n<td>内部队列，快速消费</td>\n<td>全价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>normal</td>\n<td>&lt;1h</td>\n<td>内部队列，批量消费</td>\n<td>全价或小折扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>batch</td>\n<td>&lt;24h</td>\n<td>Batch API</td>\n<td>50% 折扣</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"回调与通知模式\">回调与通知模式</h3><p>批处理完成后的结果获取方式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>轮询模式</strong>：定时查询批次状态（简单但浪费）</li>\n<li><strong>Webhook 回调</strong>：任务完成时主动通知（推荐）</li>\n<li><strong>事件流模式</strong>：通过消息队列（Kafka/SQS）消费结果</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Webhook 回调示例&#10;@app.post(&quot;/webhook/batch-complete&quot;)&#10;async def handle_batch_complete(payload: BatchResult):&#10;    batch_id = payload.batch_id&#10;    results = await download_results(payload.output_file_id)&#10;&#10;    for result in results:&#10;        await process_result(result.custom_id, result.response)&#10;        await notify_requester(result.custom_id)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Webhook 回调示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@app.post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/webhook/batch-complete\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle_batch_complete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload: BatchResult):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    batch_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload.batch_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> download_results(payload.output_file_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process_result(result.custom_id, result.response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notify_requester(result.custom_id)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"混合调度策略\">混合调度策略</h2><p>实际生产系统通常需要混合实时和批处理——同一个功能在不同场景下选择不同路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def smart_dispatch(request: LLMRequest) -&gt; LLMResponse:&#10;    if request.requires_realtime:&#10;        return await sync_call(request)&#10;&#10;    if request.deadline &lt; now() + timedelta(hours=1):&#10;        # 截止时间紧，走同步但用便宜模型&#10;        return await sync_call(request, model_override=&quot;gpt-5-mini&quot;)&#10;&#10;    if request.deadline &gt; now() + timedelta(hours=24):&#10;        # 时间充裕，走 Batch API&#10;        return await enqueue_batch(request)&#10;&#10;    # 中间地带：走内部队列，聚合后发送&#10;    return await enqueue_internal(request)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> smart_dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request: LLMRequest) -> LLMResponse:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.requires_realtime:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sync_call(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.deadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 截止时间紧，走同步但用便宜模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sync_call(request, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model_override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5-mini\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.deadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 时间充裕，走 Batch API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enqueue_batch(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 中间地带：走内部队列，聚合后发送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enqueue_internal(request)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"批次聚合优化\">批次聚合优化</h3><p>不是每个请求单独走 Batch API，而是聚合后统一提交：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间窗口聚合</strong>：每 5 分钟收集一批，统一提交</li>\n<li><strong>数量阈值聚合</strong>：累计 100 个请求后统一提交</li>\n<li><strong>混合策略</strong>：先到先聚，min(5分钟, 100个) 触发提交</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"成本对比案例\">成本对比案例</h2><p>一个内容审核系统，日均 10 万条内容需要 AI 审核：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>单次成本</th>\n<th>日成本</th>\n<th>月成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量同步（旗舰）</td>\n<td>Sonnet</td>\n<td>$0.006</td>\n<td>$600</td>\n<td>$18,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量同步（轻量）</td>\n<td>Haiku</td>\n<td>$0.002</td>\n<td>$200</td>\n<td>$6,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量 Batch（轻量）</td>\n<td>Haiku Batch</td>\n<td>$0.001</td>\n<td>$100</td>\n<td>$3,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合（10% 实时 + 90% Batch）</td>\n<td>Haiku</td>\n<td>$0.0012</td>\n<td>$120</td>\n<td>$3,600</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从全量同步旗舰切换到混合 Batch 轻量模型：<strong>月节省 $14,400（80%）</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批处理的限制与权衡\">批处理的限制与权衡</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限制</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>缓解措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>24h 返回时限不可控</td>\n<td>无法承诺精确完成时间</td>\n<td>预留缓冲时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无流式输出</td>\n<td>无法做实时进度展示</td>\n<td>批量任务加进度条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理延迟</td>\n<td>格式错误要等批次完成才知道</td>\n<td>小批量试跑验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求无法取消</td>\n<td>提交后无法撤回单个请求</td>\n<td>设计幂等处理逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不支持工具调用</td>\n<td>Agent 场景不适用</td>\n<td>仅用于单轮无工具场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>批处理是最简单的&quot;免费午餐&quot;——仅放弃实时性就获得 50% 折扣。识别非实时场景（评估、标注、审核、内容生成）并迁移到 Batch API 是第一步；队列化架构和优先级分层让实时与批处理在同一系统中共存；混合调度策略确保紧急请求仍然实时、常规请求享受折扣。限制主要在于 24h 不可控时限和不支持工具调用。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"self-hosted-vs-api\">自建推理 vs API 采购</a> 当批处理折扣仍不够时，自建推理是否是更优选择</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批处理与异步模式","id":"批处理与异步模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时间换成本：50% 折扣的获取方式","id":"时间换成本-50-折扣的获取方式"},{"level":2,"text":"厂商 Batch API 对比","id":"厂商-batch-api-对比"},{"level":3,"text":"OpenAI Batch API 使用","id":"openai-batch-api-使用"},{"level":3,"text":"Anthropic Message Batches","id":"anthropic-message-batches"},{"level":2,"text":"适合批处理的场景识别","id":"适合批处理的场景识别"},{"level":2,"text":"异步架构模式","id":"异步架构模式"},{"level":3,"text":"队列化架构","id":"队列化架构"},{"level":3,"text":"回调与通知模式","id":"回调与通知模式"},{"level":2,"text":"混合调度策略","id":"混合调度策略"},{"level":3,"text":"批次聚合优化","id":"批次聚合优化"},{"level":2,"text":"成本对比案例","id":"成本对比案例"},{"level":2,"text":"批处理的限制与权衡","id":"批处理的限制与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"缓存与去重策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/caching-deduplication"},"next":{"title":"自建推理 vs API 采购","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/self-hosted-vs-api"}}